Article 3 (Institutions Conducting Vocational Education and Training)
The term "institutions prescribed by Ordinance of the Ministry of Gender Equality and Family, including women's human resources development institutions" in Article 13 (1) of the Act means the following institutions: [Amended on October 1, 2025.]
1. Women's human resources development centers under Article 47 of the Framework Act on Gender Equality;
2. Women's economic activity support centers designated pursuant to Article 17 (1) of the Act and Article 5 of the Enforcement Decree thereof;
3. Schools under Article 2 of the Higher Education Act.
